# Security controls we are audited on

- AC-1: every account has a unique user id.
- AC-3: passwords are hashed with scrypt.
- AC-5: failed sign-ins are rate limited per account and per IP.
- AC-7: admin sessions end 12 hours after sign-in, whatever the user chose. Auditors test this every year.
- AC-9: password reset links expire after 30 minutes.
